Table full name: CHICAGO.CHICAGO_TAXI_TRIPS.TAXI_TRIPS
Column name: company Type: TEXT Description: The taxi company.
Column name: dropoff_community_area Type: NUMBER Description: The Community Area where the trip ended.
Column name: taxi_id Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier for the taxi.
Column name: trip_miles Type: FLOAT Description: Distance of the trip in miles.
Column name: unique_key Type: TEXT Description: Unique identifier for the trip.
Column name: dropoff_longitude Type: FLOAT Description: The longitude of the center of the dropoff census tract or the community area if the census tract has been hidden for privacy.
Column name: pickup_community_area Type: NUMBER Description: The Community Area where the trip began.
Column name: trip_total Type: FLOAT Description: Total cost of the trip, the total of the fare, tips, tolls, and extras.
Column name: trip_start_timestamp Type: NUMBER Description: When the trip started, rounded to the nearest 15 minutes.
Column name: trip_seconds Type: NUMBER Description: Time of the trip in seconds.
Column name: pickup_census_tract Type: NUMBER Description: The Census Tract where the trip began. For privacy, this Census Tract is not shown for some trips.
Column name: dropoff_latitude Type: FLOAT Description: The latitude of the center of the dropoff census tract or the community area if the census tract has been hidden for privacy.
Column name: trip_end_timestamp Type: NUMBER Description: When the trip ended, rounded to the nearest 15 minutes.
Column name: pickup_latitude Type: FLOAT Description: The latitude of the center of the pickup census tract or the community area if the census tract has been hidden for privacy.
Column name: tolls Type: FLOAT Description: The tolls for the trip.
